./ R 00882000          $ 00882100 100                                           
*  ISK/SSK PAIR. THE SECOND TRIPLE AT 00886000-00888000        XA0038DK         
*  RE-READS AND REWRITES THE SAME KEY BYTE NOW, SO IT IS       XA0038DK         
*  REDUNDANT RATHER THAN WRONG, AND =A(X'FFFFF8') STILL        XA0038DK         
*  CLEARS REFERENCE AND CHANGE AND KEEPS ACCESS CONTROL AND    XA0038DK         
*  FETCH-PROTECT. I-192.                                       XA0038DK         
         ISKE  R0,R14         GET REAL STORAGE KEY             XA0038DK         
./ R 00884000          $ 00884100 100                                           
         SSKE  R0,R14         SET HARDWARE KEY                 XA0038DK         
./ R 00886000          $ 00886100 100                                           
         ISKE  R0,R14         GET REAL STORAGE KEY             XA0038DK         
./ R 00888000          $ 00888100 100                                           
         SSKE  R0,R14         SET IN NEW STORAGE KEY           XA0038DK         
